        RAISE EXCEPTION 'CHECK 66 FAILED: a relationship took an unknown kind';
    EXCEPTION
        WHEN check_violation THEN NULL;
    END;

    -- **Nobody is their own guardian, coach or referrer.** Allowing it would make `is_assigned`
